{"id": "XH-073", "claim": "创业中优先模仿已经由普通经营者验证、流程简单且单位经济为正的模型，可能比从零发明高复杂度概念有更高存活率。", "source_dates": ["2026-08-04"], "category": "business_model", "implied_rule": "先验证真实客流、毛利、复购、租金人工和现金回收期，再决定是否投入；管理叙事不能替代单位经济。", "operationalization": "按商业模式复杂度和同类可验证盈利样本分组，比较新项目12/24个月存活率、现金回收期和最大累计亏损。", "expected_effect_on_exit_leak": "已有可复制盈利样本且单位经济清晰的组应有更高存活率和更低左尾损失。", "status": "candidate (distilled 2026-08-04; authority=0 — must pass research_exit_priors/research_run + §10 before any param change)", "authors": ["小草"], "source_refs": [{"author": "小草", "date": "2026-08-04", "evidence_sha256": ["ba7f92b707818842e5f705c4aa6f74e03a098e9d1057e2ea708cbf3768e007ae"], "file": "2026-08-04_xiaocao_morning.json", "source": "xiaoetong_live_opencli_capture"}]}
{"id": "XH-074", "claim": "轮动环境中，次日首次高抛信号退出、无信号再收盘退出，可能比固定开盘或固定收盘退出具有更好的风险收益。", "source_dates": ["2026-08-05"], "category": "exit_prior", "implied_rule": "只在通过模式资格的短线样本中比较首次高抛、开盘和收盘退出；研究通过前不修改现有退出规则。", "operationalization": "按环境、模式和开盘缺口分层，对同一候选比较次日开盘卖、首次高抛信号卖和收盘卖的收益、最大回撤、卖飞幅度与成交可得性。", "expected_effect_on_exit_leak": "首次高抛信号应在不显著增加回撤的前提下提高平均退出收益；若优势只来自少数右尾或内部表格偏差，则拒绝。", "status": "candidate (distilled 2026-08-05; authority=0 — must pass research_exit_priors/research_run + §10 before any param change)", "authors": ["小草"], "source_refs": [{"author": "小草", "date": "2026-08-05", "evidence_sha256": ["10f2fa86dcf787ffdc13baf680555e810403a1af4e38a1aebe95a533bfc08e5a"], "file": "2026-08-05_xiaocao_review.json", "source": "baidu_netdisk_opencli_dom"}]}
{"id": "XH-075", "claim": "市场风格切换是渐进过程，按当下环境和模式资格逐级调整仓位，可能比预测单一拐点更稳健。", "source_dates": ["2026-08-05", "2026-08-06", "2026-08-09", "2026-08-10", "2026-08-11"], "category": "position_sizing", "implied_rule": "把环境评分、模式资格和亏钱效应作为分档输入；不以某一天或历史日历作为满仓开关。", "operationalization": "比较分档调整、一次性满仓押拐点和固定仓位三种策略在多轮风格切换中的收益、最大回撤、换手和恢复时间。", "expected_effect_on_exit_leak": "分档调整应减少错误拐点造成的左尾，代价是少量初段收益；若长期收益和回撤都不改善则拒绝。", "status": "candidate (distilled 2026-08-05; authority=0 — must pass research_exit_priors/research_run + §10 before any param change)", "authors": ["小草"], "source_refs": [{"author": "小草", "date": "2026-08-05", "evidence_sha256": ["10f2fa86dcf787ffdc13baf680555e810403a1af4e38a1aebe95a533bfc08e5a"], "file": "2026-08-05_xiaocao_review.json", "source": "baidu_netdisk_opencli_dom"}, {"author": "小草", "date": "2026-08-06", "evidence_sha256": ["eb5c7b158c80818004970d7bd20b9d936f5d5a8a1c593023a962120ad3474f2a"], "file": "2026-08-06_xiaocao_review.json", "source": "baidu_netdisk_opencli_dom"}, {"author": "小草", "date": "2026-08-09", "evidence_sha256": ["8c251ac79e71f3e34f5fe8746be534fa87294b0e5eafa0e00b4bd3e66ca1e136"], "file": "2026-08-09_xiaocao_evening.json", "source": "baidu_netdisk_opencli_dom"}, {"author": "小草", "date": "2026-08-10", "evidence_sha256": ["894d0f90f332627b65c7e57b06dd7db4417e46160fe7b8d5a1d76df8cc665166"], "file": "2026-08-10_xiaocao_morning.json", "source": "baidu_netdisk_opencli_dom"}, {"author": "小草", "date": "2026-08-10", "evidence_sha256": ["7b6469d1af2e48db74bba003029e6fa4f79fe0782692733be1bce9cfd502c5e3"], "file": "2026-08-10_xiaocao_review.json", "source": "baidu_netdisk_opencli_dom"}, {"author": "小草", "date": "2026-08-11", "evidence_sha256": ["cd1889d85764c11b285bafe520c539d8fb17cb0b7671f3ffef3f9a5b36c0d121"], "file": "2026-08-11_xiaocao_review.json", "source": "baidu_netdisk_opencli_dom"}]}
